{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1168060-recruiting-exalted-3e-pbp-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne","id":1168060,"title":"[Recruiting, Exalted 3e PbP] The Pirates of the Gilded Throne","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-12-15T17:46:39-08:00","id":1168060,"title":"[Recruiting, Exalted 3e PbP] The Pirates of the Gilded Throne","content":"So, after an extended absence, I've decided to start up a new PbP game right here on the Onyx Path Forums.<br /> <br /> In the Dreaming Sea, legends still tell of the awesome might and derring -do of Yuugo Al-Argentum, the dread scourge of the Shogun's fleets. On top of this, despite being caught and hung for his crimes over a millennia ago, the great golden sailor's legacy lives on, also through tales of his great treasure. Hoarding all his riches on an unknown island, said to be able to move from place to place, mariners of the Dreaming Sea dubbed the mythic Land the Gilded Throne, for how the very land itself was said to be paved with gold. None have found evidence of it, however, and few who seek it return alive. However, a new surge of interest is sweeping the Dreaming Sea, and some say that Yuugo's spirit walks again.....<br /> <br /> Will ye be the ones t' find the Gilded Throne? <br /> <br /> If ye have the heart of an adventurer an' the stones to weather such glory, then state yer interest here!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-15T17:48:07-08:00","id":1168062,"title":"","content":"I'm in. I believe I will play an awareness-supernal Night caste.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-15T21:44:18-08:00","id":1168122,"title":"","content":"I'm in with a Supernal Craft Twilight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-16T17:16:21-08:00","id":1168274,"title":"","content":"Alrighty, then, You can find the OoC character thread here .<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1168272-ooc-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1168272-ooc-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne\"> OoC [Exalted 3e] The Pirates of the Gilded Throne - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1168272-ooc-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-